066](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13066). Any Unicode keys that are available to be used as shortcuts now are displayed as the symbol literal on PopupMenu children of a MenuBar with shortcuts of that key.\r\n\r\nFor testing, I created a [simple project](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22014691/shortcuts-test.zip) to display all the possible shortcuts.\r\n\r\nFor keypad-specific symbols, I chose to match the style of the keypad numbers and label them as \"Kp <symbol>\" so that they are distinct from the normal symbol key. Changing that, or adding/removing any symbols would be as simple as modifying `_shortcut_symbols`.\r\n\r\nVideo of Changes:\r\n\r\n[Screencast from 08-27-2025 05:45:27 PM.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/317ed534-4454-4bdc-822d-fa29038f0555)\r\n\r\nVideo of 4.4.1:\r\n\r\n[Screencast from 08-27-2025 05:46:53 PM.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a68571b4-a733-4710-9bc6-df862185bc25)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","